abstract: >-
  A reproducible research-engineering implementation of an MS MARCO
  retrieval-augmented question answering pipeline, covering lexical retrieval,
  dense retrieval, cross-encoder reranking, generation, paired statistical
  evaluation, grounding analysis, and reproducibility checks.
keywords:
